WEBVTT

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:03.980
Okay now, be seated, everyone.

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:06.630
I'll be returning your
midterm test results to you.

00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:07.780
Aww...

00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:09.160
Eew...

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:12.150
We'll be holding a supplementary exam
in one week for those of you who failed.

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:13.150
How did you do?

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:15.040
Hey! No looking!

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:16.810
It was pretty easy, wasn't it?

00:00:16.810 --> 00:00:18.620
No way anyone would need to
take the supplementary exam.

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:20.460
Report Card

00:00:47.970 --> 00:00:50.520
Just tell me! Too many choices to make...

00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:53.100
What is the answer? More than I can handle...

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:55.440
I don't know anymore! Got too much liberty...

00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:57.980
Just tell me!! Right now!!

00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:00.860
Get my words, take my rights!

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:03.240
Unable to put up with this inescapable reality,

00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:03.360
Get my words, take my rights!
Unable to put up with this inescapable reality,

00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:05.700
Get my words, take my rights!

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:08.160
Everyone's lying to themselves!

00:01:08.320 --> 00:01:10.660
After all this grieving... wailing...

00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:12.950
has something managed to change?

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:15.830
We run away before the fight even starts,

00:01:15.830 --> 00:01:18.840
as a sorrowful yesterday enters refrain.

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:24.720
Get up now! These twised emotions have nowhere to go-

00:01:24.760 --> 00:01:27.390
It's a problem everyone faces

00:01:27.390 --> 00:01:29.850
unable to even sleep at night!

00:01:29.850 --> 00:01:31.060
C'mon and Break down!

00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:34.690
Abandon any half-assed resolutions!

00:01:34.950 --> 00:01:39.480
Whether this future can be broken through, or not- you'll never know unless you try!

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:45.030
Searching for an answer, even questioning the times you live in,

00:01:45.030 --> 00:01:49.410
No one is going to give you an answer!

00:01:49.410 --> 00:01:55.210
So let loose that feeling engraved in your heart-

00:01:55.210 --> 00:01:59.040
Choose your liberty... and take it in hand!

00:02:05.390 --> 00:02:05.430
Whoa... The room's so dirty.

00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:07.190
"Handa-kun and the Supplementary Exam"

00:02:07.190 --> 00:02:10.730
I'm letting everyone use my place to study,
so quit whining and shut up.

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:13.190
I'm kind of jealous you can live on your own,
even though you were a delinquent.

00:02:13.730 --> 00:02:16.570
From now on, let's use this place as
the Handa Force's secret headquarters.

00:02:16.570 --> 00:02:19.160
Well, if it's for Handa-san, I can't complain.

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:21.700
Come on, you two. Study seriously.

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:24.160
If two of our Handa Force
members can't pass this exam,

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:26.160
there's no way we'll be able to face Handa-kun!

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:27.660
Okay...

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:31.290
First, let's make a sign for the
Handa Force's secret headquarters.

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:34.130
Wait a sec, a secret headquarters
shouldn't be putting up a sign.

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:37.800
A secret headquarters for the Handa Force
was made without Handa-kun's knowledge.

00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:39.970
Apparently, in our class,

00:02:39.970 --> 00:02:42.680
there are three people who need
to take the supplementary exam.

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:45.930
It's embarrassing that two of them
are in the Handa Force.

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:49.020
But don't worry...

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:52.480
I, our grade's top scoring student,
will tutor you both for one full week!

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:53.820
Whoa!

00:02:53.820 --> 00:02:55.440
You were ranked 1st?

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:55.780
Easy-to-Understand
<b>History
You were ranked 1st?</b>

00:02:55.780 --> 00:02:57.150
Yukicchi, where did you rank?
Easy-to-Understand
<b>History</b>

00:02:57.150 --> 00:02:57.490
Yukicchi, where did you rank?

00:02:57.490 --> 00:02:59.110
Average. Got a problem?

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:00.110
Hm?

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:01.070
What?

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:03.070
Well, it just dawned on me, but...

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:05.700
If Aizawa was ranked 1st...

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:07.830
...then what was Handa's rank?

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:11.330
That never crossed my mind.

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:13.750
I just thought he would naturally be ranked 1st.

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:14.630
That's right!

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:18.720
It says I'm ranked 1st,
but something is definitely wrong...

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:20.880
If he isn't 1st, then maybe he's ranked 2nd.

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:22.340
Of course not!

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:24.890
You just made it sound
like Handa lost to Aizawa.

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:25.810
But...

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:27.850
It's not like Handa not to be 1st.

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:28.850
He's right!

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:31.060
Handa-san should always be number one!

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:33.690
That means there's only one possibility...

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:38.490
He purposely failed to take 1st place.

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:41.240
What?!

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:43.030
Why would Handa do such a thing?

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:45.330
Um, let's get on with studying.

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:49.250
Handa-kun is a calligrapher before a student.

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:52.330
At school, he tries to avoid anything
that would make him stand out.

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:57.670
So he wants to preserve his
shadow-like presence, then...

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:02.050
I bet he's worried that letting his
intellect show through his studies

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:06.180
would get in the way of his work.

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:10.390
Everyone's worrying about their future,

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:13.060
but he already has something
important beyond just studying!

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:14.440
He's so cool!

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:17.400
Let's study.

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:18.940
Got it!

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:20.900
I'm gonna study for Handa-san!

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:22.070
Me too!

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:23.860
Do your best, Team Supplemental Exam!

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:24.950
Yeah!

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:28.540
You know, we should have invited the
other person who has to take the exam.

00:04:28.540 --> 00:04:29.790
You're right.

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:32.580
It would have been nice to see
everyone in class clear the exam.

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:35.290
After all, any shame coming from
the class is a shame to Handa-san.

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:37.290
That's a pretty pushy thing to say...

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:38.500
For Handa!

00:04:39.050 --> 00:04:40.420
For Handa-kun!

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:42.420
For Handa-san!

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:44.380
Come on, let's study already...

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:45.890
Handa Force
Secret HQ

00:04:45.890 --> 00:04:48.970
I collated questions into these
notebooks for the two of you.

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:50.430
See?

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:51.520
Whoa!

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:53.440
You're the best, Aizawa!

00:04:53.440 --> 00:04:56.900
But just studying like normal at this point is...

00:04:58.060 --> 00:04:59.020
This is...!

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:01.820
What revolution is as important
as the Handa Revolution?

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:04.740
The 15th Shogun of the Tokugawa Clan
is not Handa, but...?

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:06.660
Seek the value of Handa.

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:10.030
"Handa" is to "calligrapher"
as "Oda Nobunaga" is to what?

00:05:10.540 --> 00:05:12.000
You're a genius!

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:16.330
Genius aside, he's pretty imaginative.

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:16.790
<b>Secret
For Kondo-kun</b>

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:16.920
For Kondo-kun

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:19.590
Second-year students
taking the supplemental exam,

00:05:19.590 --> 00:05:22.090
please report to the Year 2 Class 7 room.

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:25.050
I did what I could.

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:26.550
Now, do your best!

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:28.760
Make a great country in 1192...

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:30.430
Make great poultry...

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:31.560
Crying in Nara in 794...

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:33.890
Gonna kill any cries, even from nightingales...

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:38.100
You guys may be stupid,
but you're both awesome.

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:38.940
Why do we have to take the exam in Class 7?

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:40.520
Like everyone else, treat me 1.732 times...

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:40.730
Why do we have to take the exam in Class 7?

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:41.070
Isn't, it obvious?

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:42.650
If you're treating, treat me to sushi...

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:45.280
It's because this is Handa-kun's class.

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:46.280
Ah, I see!

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:47.860
Coming in, Class 7 students.

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:49.740
Is Handa-kun's seat available?

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:51.280
I want to sit in his seat!

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:54.580
So, we have two idiots from Class 5
taking the supplementary exam.

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:57.750
Well, I am only interested in running.

00:05:57.750 --> 00:05:59.000
That's not good...

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:01.000
I'm different from everyone else!

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:03.840
I wrote "Handa" as my name!

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:05.720
He's the number-one moron in our grade.

00:06:06.170 --> 00:06:07.840
Now then, let's get this exam over with.

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:09.300
You! Dangerous Higashino!

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:10.090
Huh?

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:12.560
What the hell are you doing,
trying to sit in Handa-san's desk?!

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:13.390
Huh?!

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:15.640
It says there we can sit wherever we want!
<b>Students from the other classes
may sit where they please</b>

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:19.770
You're gonna dirty his desk
with how easily you puke, idiot!

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:21.440
He's right! I'm the one who will sit here!

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:22.940
What do you mean, puke easily?

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:24.150
It's only a desk...

00:06:31.030 --> 00:06:31.870
I'm here.

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:36.290
Guard Handa-san's desk with your life!

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:38.670
Even if he's not here, his desk is a sanctuary!

00:06:38.670 --> 00:06:40.830
Once! Let me sit here just once!

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:44.500
Are you stupid?! Are you planning on
having Handa sit where you once sat?!

00:06:49.180 --> 00:06:50.090
Handa-kun?

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:50.720
Handa?!

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:51.760
Handa-san?

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:53.390
Why is Handa here?

00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:55.680
Don't tell me the other person
who has to take the exam...

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:57.100
...is Handa?!

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:06.190
Okay, now everyone who has to take
the supplementary exam, take a seat.

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:07.990
Well, do your best.

00:07:09.650 --> 00:07:12.530
There's no way Handa-san would have
to take the supplementary exam!

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:14.410
Maybe he forgot to write his name?

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:16.700
No... There's no way
he'd make a gaffe like that.

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:18.830
There's no way Handa would have
to take the supplementary exam.

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:21.620
Was it the name?
Did he forget to write his name down?

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:23.670
Nah, there's no way that would happen.

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:25.340
Handa taking the supplementary exam?

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:26.840
I thought he was smart.

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:29.340
Could he have forgotten
to write his name down?

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:32.180
He wouldn't make a common mistake like that.

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:34.970
There's no way Handa-kun
would take a supplementary exam.

00:07:35.560 --> 00:07:38.930
There's no way he'd make the stupid mistake
of forgetting to write his name down.

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:41.020
So then why is Handa...

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:43.690
...taking the supplementary exam?!

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:52.910
Stupid me...

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:56.740
I forgot to write my name down.

00:07:57.870 --> 00:08:00.410
My score wasn't bad, either.

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:02.420
I would have placed 25th in my grade...

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:05.380
...which is pretty good, if only I hadn't
forgotten to write my name.

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:09.710
It seems like it won't affect my school report
since it was just an oversight, but...

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:12.800
If you do that on the final exam,
you're done for.

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:15.550
I'm going to have you take the supplementary
exam as a reminder of what you have done.

00:08:17.970 --> 00:08:21.930
It's such a waste to have to
spend my Sunday like this...

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:24.940
He's taking it like it's nothing?!

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:29.400
Why?

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:30.440
Hey!

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:32.070
I'm going to count that as cheating, you know?

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:41.290
Having to take a test in the same class
as Handa-kun is so nerve-wracking.

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:43.790
Dang it... I need to focus.

00:08:44.170 --> 00:08:45.750
15th Shogun of the Tokugawa Clan?

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:48.130
I'm pretty sure I studied this...

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:50.800
Um... Um...!

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:52.340
Ah...

00:08:52.340 --> 00:08:52.880
Huh?

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:54.630
Ah...

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:55.430
Ah-choo!

00:08:57.550 --> 00:08:57.970
Shoot...

00:08:57.970 --> 00:08:58.720
Blush
Shoot...

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:01.430
That was pretty loud,
in such a quiet place.
Blush

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:01.640
Blush

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:02.930
Sneeze...

00:09:02.930 --> 00:09:04.270
Handa-san's sneeze...

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:08.150
I didn't expect to see the day I'd
hear Handa-kun's sneeze so clearly.

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:10.820
What a rare experience.

00:09:10.820 --> 00:09:12.860
Handa sneezes too.

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:15.200
I wonder if everyone's angry.

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:17.120
Well, yeah...

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:21.620
Handa is human, so it's only
natural that he would sneeze too.

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:23.450
I feel closer to him now.

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:26.500
That was embarrassing.

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:30.630
Hm?

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:32.760
He's making scratching noises all of a sudden.

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:37.640
Maybe he can't control his writing
because he's used to using brushes.

00:09:37.640 --> 00:09:39.180
He's just scratching away at it...

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:43.810
I didn't know he had a habit like that.

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:45.690
This is a really rare experience.

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:49.900
From this very moment, that scratching
is the trend for me to follow.

00:09:50.690 --> 00:09:51.650
I'll give it a try, too.

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:58.740
I'm not sure if my answers are correct,
but oddly enough, I can't stop writing.

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:01.160
And all because I want to make this noise.

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:05.200
I have to hand it to Speed Handa...

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:07.830
The scratching from his pen
is instigating everyone.

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:12.920
Everyone in class is fighting
together as one with Handa.

00:10:35.690 --> 00:10:38.150
What's with all the noise today?

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:44.990
That's it, everyone.

00:10:44.990 --> 00:10:47.000
Turn over your papers
and bring them over to me.

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:49.500
How did you guys do?

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:53.090
That was really fun.

00:10:53.090 --> 00:10:55.550
We were fighting together as one with Handa.

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:58.380
Being able to write the answers
so easily was a first for me.

00:10:58.380 --> 00:10:59.430
Fighting?

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:00.720
Against who?

00:11:02.550 --> 00:11:03.550
"The next day"

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:05.770
We got passing scores!
"The next day"

00:11:05.770 --> 00:11:07.770
"The next day"

00:11:07.770 --> 00:11:08.100
Barely

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:10.520
It's all because you tutored us.
Barely

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:10.770
It's all because you tutored us.

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:12.400
What are you saying?

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:14.190
It's because both of you did your best!

00:11:14.190 --> 00:11:15.320
Good for you.

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:20.150
But it was Handa-kun who
drew out the best in both of you.

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:21.410
Yeah...

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:22.950
You're right.

00:11:22.950 --> 00:11:23.870
Huh, really?

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:29.710
I thought Handa didn't take 1st place
because he wanted to prioritize his work...

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:32.380
...but he's more of a man than to think like that.

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:36.300
Handa-san went in to take
the supplementary exam...

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:39.090
...because he didn't want to forsake us failures.

00:11:39.670 --> 00:11:42.970
We said we didn't want to shame Handa-kun,
but Handa-kun willfully bore the shame for us.

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:50.310
Handa-kun is such an outstanding person.

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:51.770
Yeah.

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:53.770
Thank you, Handa-kun.

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:56.190
Huh?

00:11:58.150 --> 00:12:00.610
<i>You have to write your name</i>

00:12:02.740 --> 00:12:07.740
As usual, Handa-kun is admired
completely unawares.

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:13.040
As for Dash-kun and the fake, Nise-kun...

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:20.970
My name is Hirayama Kasumi.

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:25.850
I work as the school librarian, checking out
books during lunch and after school.

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:29.810
With the recent decline of
reading books among youths...

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:32.850
...the library is, as usual, desolate.

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:39.570
Costs were cut to buy more books, and now
the place is starting to lose its purpose.

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:46.450
I know it's tough, but there's
something that keeps me going...

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:51.700
Love is here.

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:52.540
He's here!

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:53.250
<i>"Handa-kun and the Library"</i>

00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:55.790
My dear prince who comes to
borrow books every so often...

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:56.580
<i>"Handa-kun and the Library"</i>

00:12:56.580 --> 00:12:57.500
...Handa-kun!

00:12:57.500 --> 00:12:57.920
<i>"Handa-kun and the Library"</i>

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:02.970
As usual, he's so dreamy...

00:13:09.010 --> 00:13:13.430
I wonder what kind of girl
Handa-kun thinks I am.

00:13:14.690 --> 00:13:17.860
He must think that I'm just
a quiet and boring girl.

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:21.820
After all, I am really shy....

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:32.540
There's someone there!

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:35.710
But I want him to notice...

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:41.840
...that I'm spending most of whatever
limited funds I get for his benefit.

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:44.760
There's a new book in.

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:47.720
That's from me...

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:51.720
I feel like I'm about the only one
who would read a niche book like this.

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:54.020
Wait... I won't read it too.

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:58.150
Some of them were out of print,
so it cost me a fortune.

00:13:59.110 --> 00:14:02.190
I wonder if he'll also notice...

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:03.070
...that in the Handa Corner, there's one
romance novel amid the assortment of books.

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:07.820
The Bookshelf of Love

00:14:07.820 --> 00:14:13.790
It's a love story between the coolest
kid in school and a dull librarian.

00:14:14.410 --> 00:14:16.710
Kiss, kiss, kiss, kiss...

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:18.540
Shiver

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:21.790
Wander-wander

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:29.390
As expected, he's not
checking out the romance novel.

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:37.180
I figured as much, so I cloaked the
romance novel with a cover on calligraphy.

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:43.020
Please read the romance novel and
take notice of your dull heroine in wait.

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:49.030
Hey, I can't find Handa anywhere.

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:50.700
He should be here today checking out books.

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:52.620
Most of the time, no one comes here,

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:53.030
Maybe he's hiding somewhere to surprise us.

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:55.830
but every so often Handa-kun's
followers come in like this.

00:14:55.830 --> 00:14:56.160
Maybe he's hiding somewhere to surprise us.

00:14:56.620 --> 00:15:00.540
I don't like them because they follow
Handa-kun as if they were privileged.

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:02.630
There's only a bunch of musty books here.

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:04.590
Hey!

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:06.130
Whoa! Didn't know you were there!

00:15:06.130 --> 00:15:07.420
What are you doing?!

00:15:07.420 --> 00:15:08.470
Treat the Handa Cor—

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:09.090
No!

00:15:09.090 --> 00:15:11.640
Treat the books in the library with respect!

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:15.060
I'm sorry, Librarian-san, for the commotion.

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:16.270
Sorry.

00:15:16.270 --> 00:15:17.430
Really...

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:19.980
You guys should learn a thing
or two from Handa-kun.

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:22.020
Did you order all the books here?

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:24.270
So?! What's it to you?!

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:26.280
Don't touch that! It was expensive!

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:30.030
Well, I thought it was pretty
obvious these were for Handa.

00:15:30.030 --> 00:15:30.860
Stop it!

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:33.370
I'm not like one of those
scrubby fans out there!

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:33.410
Blush
I'm not like one of those
scrubby fans out there!

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:35.910
I'm a lady seeking romance
with Handa-kun, and...
Blush

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:37.660
You're not hiding much as a fan.

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:41.290
I'm no ordinary fan!

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:43.500
Destiny awaits for me to meet Handa-kun,

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:46.250
and a love affair is going to unfold,
just like in a romance novel.

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:51.630
Neither of us notices it yet, but there's a red
string of fate tying our little fingers together.

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:55.810
But that doesn't mean you should
just keep gathering old books.

00:15:55.810 --> 00:15:56.390
Huh?

00:15:56.850 --> 00:16:00.310
A fashion leader like Handa
can't do without fashion magazines.

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:03.850
A library not having any
magazines is so last year.

00:16:03.850 --> 00:16:04.400
Huh?

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:09.070
Handa-san's a strong fighter too,
so can you order some books on martial arts?

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:10.570
He'd want dime novels too, right?

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:11.820
Huh?

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:14.070
Wait! What's with all your orders?!

00:16:14.070 --> 00:16:19.160
While we're at it, let's make this
desolate library like brand new again!

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:20.500
Yeah, let's do it!

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:21.540
Sounds good!

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:23.830
Huh? What do you guys
mean by "while we're at it"?!

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:25.840
Stop trying to do stuff by yourselves!

00:16:25.840 --> 00:16:29.510
A librarian has to select books that
are sought by all the students in school!

00:16:29.510 --> 00:16:31.970
They shouldn't put their feelings
ahead of everyone else!

00:16:31.970 --> 00:16:34.760
And this romance novel is for whom, again?

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:37.850
Stop! Stop it! It's not like I'm longing for him!

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:43.270
If you're an expert on books,
then we're experts on Handa-kun.

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:47.690
Leave it to us and we'll fix the
library to fit Handa-san's tastes.

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:53.030
Well, I suppose they are closer to Handa-kun.

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:54.360
Not really

00:16:54.570 --> 00:16:56.070
I guess I can leave it to them...

00:16:56.910 --> 00:17:00.580
...to make this library into a place
that Handa-kun will truly love.

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:08.790
And so, the Handa Force collected various
genres of books to create a new library.

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:12.630
Meanwhile, Handa-kun...

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:14.300
Ta-da!

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:15.970
Wow!

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:17.680
Look at all those books!

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:20.180
How did you guys gather so many
books with my limited budget?

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:23.850
We just called everyone in class
to donate their used books.

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:26.650
I don't believe it!
Look at all these new books!

00:17:26.650 --> 00:17:31.150
Everyone was happy to help
when we said it was for Handa-kun!

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:34.280
I wonder if Handa-kun will
come here even more now.

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:36.160
It's not only Handa-kun, you know?

00:17:36.160 --> 00:17:36.700
Huh?

00:17:40.240 --> 00:17:44.000
All the students came after hearing
about the newly reborn library.

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:45.500
There's so many here!

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:46.330
Can I check out this book?

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:47.580
<b>Triple Apple 3
Can I check out this book?</b>

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:48.080
<b>Kill all Men</b>

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:49.590
Let me check out the entire set.

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:53.380
Come on now, do your best, Librarian!

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:54.630
By myself?!

00:17:54.630 --> 00:17:56.470
Someone, help!

00:17:59.300 --> 00:18:01.760
In order, please!

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:03.930
Busy-busy

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:07.520
Looks like there are a lot
of students here today.

00:18:07.940 --> 00:18:11.520
I still have time before I have to return this,
so I'll come back when the crowd's gone.

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:17.240
The library has been very busy since then.

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:20.490
With the bustling of students
coming to check out books,

00:18:20.490 --> 00:18:22.740
it was as though the silence
back then never existed.

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:25.870
My days as a librarian are now
constantly busy with work, but...

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:26.330
Beep, beep-beep
My days as a librarian are now
constantly busy with work, but...

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:26.750
My days as a librarian are now
constantly busy with work, but...

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:28.540
Stupid hair.

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:32.880
...I liked books to begin with, so my everyday
life has been surprisingly fulfilling.

00:18:33.800 --> 00:18:34.710
But...

00:18:34.710 --> 00:18:36.840
The Bookshelf of Love

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:40.340
Good work as usual.

00:18:41.100 --> 00:18:44.310
Thanks to you the place is
really busy now, Aizawa-kun.

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:46.980
The Student Council says
they will increase your funds.

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:48.020
Really?

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:49.850
Now I can add even more books.

00:18:50.980 --> 00:18:53.360
I see you're wearing the
expression of a librarian.

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:56.900
Looks like Handa-kun did it again.

00:18:56.900 --> 00:18:57.400
Huh?

00:18:57.950 --> 00:19:01.910
I bet Handa-kun always wanted
this place to be like it is now.

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:03.620
But...

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:04.790
Hm?

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:10.830
But Handa-kun hasn't come to the
library since it became so active...

00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:16.170
Okay, that should do it for today.

00:19:18.010 --> 00:19:19.170
Handa-kun!

00:19:19.170 --> 00:19:21.550
He came to return that book.

00:19:22.550 --> 00:19:23.180
Um...

00:19:23.180 --> 00:19:23.640
Ba-dump

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:24.600
Y-Yes?!
Ba-dump

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:24.970
Yikes! This is the first time he's spoken to me!
Ba-dump

00:19:24.970 --> 00:19:27.310
Yikes! This is the first time he's spoken to me!

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:28.930
What, what?!

00:19:28.930 --> 00:19:31.310
Is he going to praise me
for what I've done recently?!

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:32.350
Could it be?!

00:19:32.350 --> 00:19:33.810
You have done well.

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:38.490
I feel like he's going to pat me
on the head, like right now!

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:39.860
Um... The book...

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:40.900
Here it comes!

00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:43.570
...I checked out last time
had the wrong cover on it.

00:19:43.570 --> 00:19:44.120
Ah...

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:45.780
Aaah...

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:47.330
Oh, that...

00:19:47.330 --> 00:19:49.580
I completely forgot my set-up.

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:51.670
Did you read what was inside?

00:19:51.670 --> 00:19:52.330
Inside?

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:55.460
Yikes! I just went with
the flow and spoke to him!

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:57.300
Just a little.

00:19:57.300 --> 00:19:58.760
S-So how was it?!

00:19:58.760 --> 00:20:00.510
Now I'm asking for his thoughts!

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:01.430
I'm so daring!

00:20:15.310 --> 00:20:19.280
I was enthralled with how earnest
the librarian was in her work.

00:20:23.070 --> 00:20:24.110
I knew it...

00:20:26.280 --> 00:20:29.580
Handa-kun has noticed my work all this time.

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:34.500
And yet, all I thought about
was love and romance.

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:42.630
I won't be ordering any
more books on calligraphy.

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:44.300
Huh?

00:20:45.340 --> 00:20:50.350
I want to order a variety of books that
will bring more students to the library.

00:20:51.350 --> 00:20:53.690
You don't have to come
here anymore, Handa-kun.

00:20:56.520 --> 00:21:00.190
I'm going to become a
full-fledged woman for Handa-kun.

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:03.280
Guess this will be your final return!

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:17.790
I can't believe the librarian told me to
my face that I can't go there anymore.

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:18.590
Huh?

00:21:18.590 --> 00:21:20.800
What the hell did you do
to make that happen?

00:21:21.380 --> 00:21:24.050
I wonder if it's because I told her
that the cover and book didn't match.

00:21:24.680 --> 00:21:26.390
Not like I wanted to say it,

00:21:26.390 --> 00:21:28.720
but if I'd left it alone, the next person
would have been inconvenienced.

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:31.310
Oh... You mean that romance novel?

00:21:32.060 --> 00:21:34.020
That was a romance novel?

00:21:34.520 --> 00:21:36.020
You didn't read it?

00:21:36.480 --> 00:21:37.860
You know, "The Bookshelf of Love"?

00:21:37.860 --> 00:21:38.650
Nah...

00:21:38.650 --> 00:21:39.650
I wasn't interested.

00:21:40.360 --> 00:21:45.950
The librarian asked for my thoughts,
so I just repeated what you said to me about it.

00:21:45.950 --> 00:21:48.740
You mean how I was enthralled by the librarian?

00:21:49.320 --> 00:21:51.950
I'm glad you decided to give it
a read to pass the time, Kawafuji.

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:53.750
Glad to be of service.
Library

00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:54.500
Library

00:21:54.500 --> 00:21:56.620
You're the only good person around.
Library

00:21:56.620 --> 00:21:57.580
Library

00:21:57.960 --> 00:22:01.630
Handa-kun doesn't need to
come to the library anymore.

00:22:01.630 --> 00:22:02.630
Till the End of the Earth

00:22:02.630 --> 00:22:06.050
I'll go and see him from now on...
Till the End of the Earth

00:22:06.050 --> 00:22:06.260
Till the End of the Earth

00:22:06.260 --> 00:22:07.010
Smile

00:22:18.000 --> 00:22:21.860
Don't look for me- Don't look for me-

00:22:21.860 --> 00:22:25.150
I'd rather not register in anyone's gaze,

00:22:25.150 --> 00:22:31.330
'Cause I'm still not settled into this world.

00:22:33.390 --> 00:22:37.210
Though I'm so transient, I've always said,

00:22:37.290 --> 00:22:42.460
"Someday, this unfair way of living will come back to bite me!"

00:22:42.500 --> 00:22:46.720
'Cause what I really want,

00:22:46.840 --> 00:22:50.430
Is to be laughing along with everyone else!

00:22:50.510 --> 00:22:54.390
My HIDE-AND-SEEK continues...

00:22:54.470 --> 00:22:58.650
My voice still can't make a sound,

00:23:00.890 --> 00:23:06.240
But I wonder if I can communicate this... all my thoughts and feelings!

00:23:06.240 --> 00:23:11.410
I can always hear it in the distance...

00:23:11.410 --> 00:23:19.080
And someday, I'd like to once again answer that call.

00:23:19.130 --> 00:23:22.290
The day when I'll be told, "It's alright, you've done all you can,"

00:23:22.290 --> 00:23:26.550
May be closer to arribing than I thought.

00:23:40.640 --> 00:23:46.230
The big high-school event that everyone's been
waiting for, the school excursion, is almost here.

00:23:46.230 --> 00:23:48.610
Are you all ready?

00:23:48.610 --> 00:23:52.490
But this is my greatest challenge in life to date.

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:54.530
The group the teacher simply tacked me on to...

00:23:55.120 --> 00:23:55.370
Excited

00:23:55.370 --> 00:23:56.540
The super flashy playboy...

00:23:56.540 --> 00:23:56.990
Excited

00:23:56.990 --> 00:23:58.160
The truant...

00:23:58.160 --> 00:23:59.250
The fiend...

00:24:00.370 --> 00:24:01.080
Who is he?

00:24:02.120 --> 00:24:04.840
Don't get too excited just because
you're all looking forward to Kyoto.

00:24:04.840 --> 00:24:06.040
Okay.

00:24:06.040 --> 00:24:06.920
Handa-kun and the School Excursion

00:24:06.920 --> 00:24:09.760
Next time, "Handa-kun and the
School Excursion." See you again!
